     A*=========================================================================
     A* Institution: Muskegon Community College
     A* Course:      CIS170 - Intro to RPG Programming
     A* Instructor:  Char Parker
     A* Project:     Project #8 - Class Offerings at Wibaux University
     A* File:        PRJ8PRTF.PRTF
     A* Programmer:  Chris Grimm
     A* Date:        11/12/2026
     A*
     A* Description:
     A*   External printer file definition for the Wibaux University
     A*   Class Offerings report. Defines report page headers,
     A*   matched section/course detail records (`DETAIL`), and
     A*   missing course match records (`ERROR`). Utilizes `REFFLD`
     A*   to pull attributes from `WUCRSP` and `WUSCTP`.
     A*
     A* Used By:     PROJECT8.RPGLE
     A*=========================================================================
     A
     A* EXTERNAL PRINTER FILE DEFINITION FOR Wexler University Current Sections
     A                                      REF(WUSCTP)
     A          R HEADING                   SKIPB(1)
     A                                     2DATE(*SYS *YY)
     A                                      EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                   121'Page'
     A                                   128PAGNBR
     A                                      EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                     2'Christopher Grimm'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A                                    43'Class Offerings at Wibaux Universi-
     A                                      ty'
     A                                     4'Section'
     A                                      SPACEB(2)
     A                                    14'Department'
     A                                    28'Course'
     A                                    44'Course Title'
     A                                    72'Credit(s)'
     A                                    89'Time'
     A                                   105'Days'
     A                                   117'Room'
     A          R DETAIL                    SPACEB(1)
     A            SECTION   R              5
     A            DEPT      R             17
     A            CRSNO     R             29
     A            CRSTTL    R             44REFFLD(CRSREC/CRSTTL *LIBL/WUC-
     A                                      RSP)
     A            CREDIT    R             75REFFLD(CRSREC/CREDIT *LIBL/WUC-
     A                                      RSP)
     A            SECTIM    R             89EDTWRD('  :  ')
     A            SECDAY    R            105
     A            ROOM      R            117
     A          R ERROR                     SPACEB(1)
     A            SECTION   R              5
     A            DEPT      R             17
     A            CRSNO     R             29
     A                                    44'Course Not Found!'

